    "pl3": {
      "say": "So. The ledgers are open, the manifest is in your coat, and the question, investigator, is what you do with your evening.",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "Side",
          "text": "A sun for Pluto. Honestly? Earned.",
          "to": "ple1"
        },
        {
          "label": "Expose",
          "text": "The whole system will know by morning. All of it.",
          "to": "ple2"
        },
        {
          "label": "Broker",
          "text": "There's a third way: share the Second Sun. Every outpost, one sky.",
          "to": "ple3"
        }
      ]
    },
    "ple3": {
      "say": "...A shared dawn. The Mercurials prophesied a Red Nova; perhaps prophecy is only a plan that no one has priced yet. Bring us the system's signatures, investigator. Pluto will sign last — but Pluto will sign.",
      "to": "pe3"
    },
    "ple1": {
      "say": "We knew you were reasonable. Wear this signet — when the new dawn comes, it will mark you a Friend of Pluto.",
      "to": "pla1"
    },
    "pe3": {
      "say": "One sky. Thirteen outposts. A sun that belongs to everyone. The Accord begins with you."
    }
